;
; How Nutshell files one card's reviews in MYRA (nutshell_rules.h NS5): a
; sparse record under the deck and the card, with the Leitner box it is in
; (1 .. 5), the day it is next due (days since 1970) and how many times it
; was answered right and wrong. The model asks whether the numbers fit
; before it keeps the card.
^ZXNUTCARD(deck:i6, card:i4) = box:i1! ^ due:i7! ^ right:i6! ^ wrong:i6!
